WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.130
Pernah merasa telinga

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.030
tiba-tiba penuh saat pesawat turun,

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.260
lalu terdengar "pop"?

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.460
Di balik gendang telinga

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.660
ada ruang berisi udara.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.560
Saat tekanan kabin berubah,

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.570
tekanan di kedua sisi

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.160
gendang telinga belum seimbang.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.980
Gendang telinga terdorong,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.870
sehingga telinga terasa tidak nyaman

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.700
dan suara bisa terdengar teredam.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.480
Ketika kita menelan atau menguap,

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.500
saluran Eustachius

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.560
terbuka sebentar.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.450
Udara masuk, tekanannya

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:25.470
kembali seimbang,

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.260
dan muncullah sensasi "pop".

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.770
Kalau saluran ini tersumbat saat pilek,

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.210
tekanan lebih sulit seimbang

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.160
dan telinga bisa terasa lebih nyeri.

